#: scenario3:scenario3_52D2A2A6_5BE3_4196_8586_D6BF70936841
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c611ac15f1d70a0f88efe6bfc38d18db6ca02da0abb595df8b95b9c679793a93
#. default-sha256: e4771ca2803f70d53887d0e9e5e7999515fa19737a696b7b2fc7cad9aae0e83c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_52D2A2A6_5BE3_4196_8586_D6BF70936841"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫The next morning, Jacopo stood alone in the den by the billiards "
"table."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Na manhã seguinte, Jacopo estava sozinho na sala junto à mesa de "
"bilhar."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A0F51FDE_0032_46B7_9E37_076DBD34C565
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a6c068c6a752074c5926e084e7bd497e75a95fbe5425edc15c13027ce575993c
#. default-sha256: a9cddd79a6e392129f7912acd1f7306c95acbc45db2e14b190d828501e869ccf
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A0F51FDE_0032_46B7_9E37_076DBD34C565"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He appeared to be rather agitated."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ele parecia estar bastante agitado."

#: scenario3:scenario3_716AE35B_1F15_4014_A7EF_681027C6BBDE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cd34ebf5ea2590a2fdbbc3ddba68e7b8c67c0e3463b41a028d18b05b11ccc92c
#. default-sha256: 04e4bfde03a87a1b791454e5be8ef687a984dded2af694698fd3f5f7ea8a9f4c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_716AE35B_1F15_4014_A7EF_681027C6BBDE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫His face was twisted into a frown, his pointer finger tapping restlessly against the hard "
"surface of the table."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Seu rosto estava torcido em uma carranca, seu dedo indicador batendo inquieto contra a "
"superfície dura da mesa."

#: scenario3:scenario3_61C40033_1D40_401E_B3A5_DE79C4FF4BE6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 521854296ed1169418a94e5758aab39f1855a4c19c4451a4ef59d3f63c62af11
#. default-sha256: a496acc6417d62d047005ab2c0115679c4ff090fc187ec38a8a748d3ca3dfdba
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_61C40033_1D40_401E_B3A5_DE79C4FF4BE6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Evidently no longer able to stay in one place,⟪k:1⟫he paced a circle around the table,⟪k:2⟫"
"then swiped up a rack and a cue,⟪k:3⟫setting up a game of nine-ball."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Evidentemente não mais capaz de ficar em um lugar,⟪k:1⟫ele perambulou em círculo ao redor da "
"mesa,⟪k:2⟫em seguida, pegou um triângulo e um taco,⟪k:3⟫montando um jogo de bola nove."

#: scenario3:scenario3_235FD550_CC68_4883_9BEB_73160CDB082A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: caf224feb4a1c0ca7b01a48d11a7c7f67b8f5e6f1f57a69ff8ae9c7199255ef9
#. default-sha256: 3e096cd5d6b58e05492ca42d304002b76402d06212406448294bc2c26b348ccb
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_235FD550_CC68_4883_9BEB_73160CDB082A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I am not intimately familiar with the ways by which men entertain themselves, but in truth, "
"I was bewitched by the sight of him leaning over the table."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Não estou intimamente familiarizada com as maneiras pelas quais os homens se divertem, mas, "
"na verdade, fiquei enfeitiçada ao vê-lo debruçado sobre a mesa."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C3DC4ABC_3CD9_4511_A4B2_7771DA2C2B1E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8beb891048869e5b2f7a20da7cc39ebbc8658e7c0b0897971d647751791e62d3
#. default-sha256: d93a7d705e9b2b57525d8d4f6a669f423606fee588dbc70723b0242520609e2f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C3DC4ABC_3CD9_4511_A4B2_7771DA2C2B1E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It almost seemed as though a steel rod ran straight from his shoulder to the tip of his "
"outstretched finger, upon which the cue was secured by another finger looped over it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quase parecia como se uma haste de aço corresse direto de seu ombro até a ponta de seu dedo "
"estendido, sobre o qual o taco estava preso por outro dedo enrolado sobre ele."

#: scenario3:scenario3_77C3C8BB_D837_4967_9254_8B45736A2CBB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a673465a57ea3e7926154cb77b39bb9cac6e24d80ce008af7b9cfda2824fe8c3
#. default-sha256: bcc1a334d164ac12686ce55903644111035a62d62da19560e0f61ac5cf58967f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_77C3C8BB_D837_4967_9254_8B45736A2CBB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫With a smooth, flowing motion, he thrust the cue forward slightly, pulling it back and "
"repeating the process once more..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Com um movimento suave e fluido, ele levemente deu uma estocada para a frente, puxando-o "
"para trás e repetindo o processo mais uma vez..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_243CAC15_920E_473F_986D_47BC5C4EFD19
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 99ca133e7a043a1f11dd71947c7949e0a0fc2037ee186643ccfd26a0c2409583
#. default-sha256: eb5d1134e4fceed1de04094fb719bed5c006d4b66108fa98e25b5f70831fdfbe
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_243CAC15_920E_473F_986D_47BC5C4EFD19"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫before ramming it into the cue ball, sending it rolling into the diamond of colored "
"balls. ⟪k:2⟫A chorus of ⟪k:3⟫click⟪k:4⟫s and ⟪k:5⟫clack⟪k:6⟫s emanated from the center of the "
"room."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫antes de bater na bola branca, enviando-a rolando para o losango de bolas coloridas. "
"⟪k:2⟫Um coro de ⟪k:3⟫cliques⟪k:4⟫ e ⟪k:5⟫claques⟪k:6⟫ emanou do centro da sala."

#: scenario3:scenario3_32B08C6F_C677_4FC8_A80F_B6F661D3B11D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c7fb810133db251d91b680b36dd529a85ca9cc869bf2936c12c0ca742df5c549
#. default-sha256: 87184cc799a7989d0e7100ad39b589ae7069871e844627a2c7a19623a2666a64
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_32B08C6F_C677_4FC8_A80F_B6F661D3B11D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Balls collided with one another and ricocheted off the cushioned walls, a few landing in the "
"pockets situated around the edge of the table."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Bolas colidiram umas com as outras e ricochetearam nas paredes almofadadas, algumas caindo "
"nas caçapas situadas ao redor da borda da mesa."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9AD8D874_3530_497C_8B36_E1E928C2B206
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 047aefa6946ebc80e6f96cfd5332b83477ff3a851e18d5193555143442a45792
#. default-sha256: 0cfd417d997b7c653d545f836fbcbc3955cca8cf17c1dd1d60244e27328123a2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9AD8D874_3530_497C_8B36_E1E928C2B206"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Jacopo appeared to have accomplished this with little trouble, but I imagine merely striking "
"the cue ball with the stick would be rather difficult for someone inexperienced."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Jacopo parecia ter conseguido isso com pouca dificuldade, mas imagino que apenas acertar a "
"bola branca com o taco seria bastante difícil para alguém inexperiente."

#: scenario3:scenario3_87B9FABD_0AF8_4D8E_888C_A3CF4F854016
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f9d6ec9a2dbe5d69cefdc39220eb781823a42e341c67e4e0d72cbae131fa4b43
#. default-sha256: a4b1a696dcb7501ce627c03c4efa06af724f24274fbc88be6fe69c75b5f99dac
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_87B9FABD_0AF8_4D8E_888C_A3CF4F854016"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But despite his accomplishment, it seemed to only exacerbate his agitation."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mas, apesar de seu feito, pareceu apenas exacerbar sua agitação."

#: scenario3:scenario3_959AC811_76E7_4738_9FCA_55B66A009317
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 90e23f761d4a8c774a30d3cb75bda387736625d377ab89a4e519bf932d3114ab
#. default-sha256: 2d8d471ac81fd17af55e6d574c234a46192bb49beed161ad53e9690519ef2009
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_959AC811_76E7_4738_9FCA_55B66A009317"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Lousy positioning,” he muttered, though I hadn’t the faintest idea what he was talking "
"about."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫\"Posicionamento ruim\", ele murmurou, embora eu não tivesse a menor ideia do que ele estava "
"falando."

#: scenario3:scenario3_E270133C_E277_4CB8_B4E3_B71C691D10D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 570fbc97b1504e7a2f183f1400b77a3133fa6fc9dd541b7592e0caf87c943bdf
#. default-sha256: e6c056430c79c8640ca07fd76b7bb5778cca494c86c59ef359ae586037fa24cc
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E270133C_E277_4CB8_B4E3_B71C691D10D4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What should have been a game for his enjoyment, he went about with a constant look of "
"exasperation."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ele seguiu, durante um jogo que deveria ter sido para sua diversão, com um olhar constante "
"de exasperação."

#: scenario3:scenario3_2FC95DA7_3AE1_4C19_AFD3_4BB7B16D0B44
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e81c612f38ae4e19706220f5bcc8017085740f1e01c389d524d2d0a8cac2a0ad
#. default-sha256: 46be560fbbe6d1690fb037ffd77c1e30dcc2251e1b6afdb09f994fa316311351
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2FC95DA7_3AE1_4C19_AFD3_4BB7B16D0B44"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I suspect he was using it as a way to blow off steam."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Eu suspeito que ele estava usando isso como uma maneira de desabafar."

#: scenario3:scenario3_51C47889_DC66_4189_9F8F_3FED3A536542
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3e5c46ba9a74d9371fcbe7f98b09cbdf225cdcb8944051c22d973e1fe70ee029
#. default-sha256: c55c13fa01a6d57f9cb73934532bf041e2d36511f3b9fda7105295e7bd67a6ef
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_51C47889_DC66_4189_9F8F_3FED3A536542"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And as a result, the tension in the air was palpable."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E, como resultado, a tensão no ar era palpável."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A510D6AC_7F9B_44BF_85F1_D2C660EFBDFD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e7e0885145f74e4e64eec149f656e10e630c1f367d685618dd8478768906cace
#. default-sha256: eba9637f819dd546cae610066130b78dc829c8214065b77ac8e8167ef149ab66
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A510D6AC_7F9B_44BF_85F1_D2C660EFBDFD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I felt it would be improper to intrude upon him, even considering my distaste for the man."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Achei que seria impróprio intrometer-se, mesmo considerando meu desgosto pelo homem."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D8E0D881_70AE_48C2_9AD8_14F49E160D98
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 51fbb95edd887800e037526f681a21aa2851cf02656229643506660560b69247
#. default-sha256: 75c4745bc28bcb17f5fd12ce964284577e3fb3b593cdc03bc49667c3e48a5118
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D8E0D881_70AE_48C2_9AD8_14F49E160D98"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There was an undeniable beauty in every motion he made, every perfectly audible ⟪k:1⟫"
"clack⟪k:2⟫ of billiards balls bouncing off one another."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Havia uma beleza inegável em cada movimento que ele fazia, cada ⟪k:1⟫claque⟪k:2⟫ "
"perfeitamente audível de bolas de bilhar quicando umas nas outras."

#: scenario3:scenario3_798A17A7_980A_4A56_8ACE_528CA242B704
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7c7b35b2f6983dc7741785c6a59cea7b4c1bf3f03f8607023291468a0fd65b3e
#. default-sha256: 7d8201af33c6c8b94d91ac7fde8509392789bab78c9bcaa80d78df3df3c45eac
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_798A17A7_980A_4A56_8ACE_528CA242B704"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was... ⟪k:1⟫an enchanting sight."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Era...⟪k:1⟫ uma visão encantadora."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D07E8173_C9AE_4047_83B1_A758FAD2AA4A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4a14e023865409b9012b85cf93f1fa232cf560bf880c5431dc09c2cf9aef1bb7
#. default-sha256: 822abbcd47f8aace9c5145fec7be6663a5432436156975e2dedfc0649db49ace
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D07E8173_C9AE_4047_83B1_A758FAD2AA4A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But then, someone without the slightest regard or appreciation for beauty came marching in "
"with a hammer to shatter it like glass."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mas então, alguém sem a menor consideração ou apreciação pela beleza veio marchando com um "
"martelo para estilhaçá-la como vidro."

#: scenario3:scenario3_7B37DB59_2906_47C3_8DB4_20B56BD5A096
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6a3d473624495ab718fc8c8f68dc278e56908164db7c671e6489fe252ec2d0d5
#. default-sha256: 200878bc85d0d1d0655c0fb48f764162ba005d478586ed129340098bb3af0c2a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7B37DB59_2906_47C3_8DB4_20B56BD5A096"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Gotta say, that was pretty impressive."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Tenho que dizer, isso foi bastante impressionante."

#: scenario3:scenario3_4312ACA6_E508_41CD_9B1C_5A5C8C3D221A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 471b860f74dac0b88dd92d066df272fe2f701d750584d7de374afe096ce3c9bf
#. default-sha256: d5413f510812c33b161c877dd39ab1f60a3a60730b00e17afea4ba1438db3df9
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4312ACA6_E508_41CD_9B1C_5A5C8C3D221A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫...!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_53A099CE_6249_4467_BC84_4B848C0DE1D0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b7158b54734aec42671fcc730f741bcd5b11081d5f6e4470da48b74b333cd94c
#. default-sha256: 7d250e3cdbc5f6e2ad1cfe86d9ac86170581b58ef40e3dc6963ca30dd059039c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_53A099CE_6249_4467_BC84_4B848C0DE1D0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫A man leaned against the frame of the open door—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫he was neither a resident nor "
"worker of the mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Um homem encostado ao batente da porta aberta—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫não era morador nem empregado da "
"mansão."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DEA168F3_64C0_4E53_BEE0_05349674E065
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1eaefd7988c5ae66040db4e80daa099208e75e2864389f6e96181c11388f3b45
#. default-sha256: ae0b1a8502e875ba2843325dc96809b565af80e9c05c7667b9b85bd938954fce
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DEA168F3_64C0_4E53_BEE0_05349674E065"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The man’s face was covered in scraggly stubble, his body draped in grime-caked garments. "
"⟪k:1⟫His eyes were sunken so deep it was as though I was looking at a fleshless skull—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫"
"though there was a feral glimmer in them."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫O rosto do homem estava coberto de barba por fazer, seu corpo envolto em roupas encardidas. "
"⟪k:1⟫Seus olhos estavam tão fundos que era como se eu estivesse olhando para um crânio sem carne—"
"⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫embora houvesse um brilho feroz neles."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F746C573_71F2_40C1_9A53_877C72A2260E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4d2c11d64e89c7e4d6da43270f56a46ad843e89e8d78d6c61e6dbacaac928f7d
#. default-sha256: 90a30d20889168175c388f3f2e9671457090ce9a1a8b365a3d7c8af562d78d68
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F746C573_71F2_40C1_9A53_877C72A2260E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Needless to say, he was not prim and proper."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Desnecessário dizer, ele não era asseado e respeitável."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D45A122A_CE3C_4BB3_8488_C7FFF59FC7A7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b3d8b17891a8cc3d09fd76dbf8843e7dd56341350e6f4afafb7e676110973c32
#. default-sha256: 8c77603e80865edbe96f68d9cf1a083db73676012c27cf1d40f03ed218afb42a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D45A122A_CE3C_4BB3_8488_C7FFF59FC7A7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫How long have you been there?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Há quanto tempo você está aí?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_1D8BB6EE_B72B_4AE3_8BD5_1B75B210273B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a23ae2824c6c07428c55de1d4572b03748f70aef89e924d5d378e3bff808ef78
#. default-sha256: ea7814b5e54f9c7befe00fd6afdf234b9eb6e44a90bdaa4a8fef61a5773150e7
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_1D8BB6EE_B72B_4AE3_8BD5_1B75B210273B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Not long. But man, I can’t help laughin’.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫You were ⟪k:6⟫"
"completely⟪k:7⟫ in your own world there."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Não muito. Mas cara, não consigo deixar de rir.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Você estava ⟪k:6⟫"
"completamente⟪k:7⟫ em seu próprio mundo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_13D5D87F_9F1C_4BB0_8B1B_96D89F0B7219
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7cb400be1c471372f1b5e0922b3e3526f384978c077b2713ca9e7aeb954bbda5
#. default-sha256: 6e7f44a621771634cd46bc131851ec062953f765d447679c6a2e6e0f63d04d60
